{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122, the massive free-to-play combat arena. Experience thrilling modes &amp; new gameplay features in Verdansk and Rebirth Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Threats Rise in Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may be cold out, but the drop zone\u2019s still hot. Experience a snow-covered Rebirth Island, complete with a new POI, environmental updates, new gameplay features, and a few more surprises along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a change of pace, check out some fan-favorite modes and additional new weekend LTMs. Plus Ranked Play: Resurgence makes its Black Ops 7 debut. Season 02 of Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122 is here, and it\u2019s just getting started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot For Rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover supply boxes and complete contracts to build your arsenal and gain a tactical advantage.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1962663?t=1770663938","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962663/0fc41bf8af50953c5d3784fb4acbe5c65acc0f83/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770663938","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962663/84a5d6150e49013a9b30c62d87cb5df602e2ef26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770663938","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962663/84a5d6150e49013a9b30c62d87cb5df602e2ef26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770663938","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions availa